      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "一作少皞，传说中远古东夷族的首领，名挚(一作“质”)，一说号金天氏"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-35",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西二百里，曰长留之山，其神白帝少昊居之。其兽皆文尾，其鸟皆文首。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "东海之外大壑，少昊之国。少昊孺帝颛顼于此，弃其琴"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-10",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "生季釐，故曰季釐之国。有缗渊。少昊生倍伐，倍伐降处缗渊。有水四方"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-16",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "人一目，当面中生。一曰是威姓，少昊之子，食黍。"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
